{"id":"n7beb318d58","headline":"Bank Credit Growth Hits Two-Year High, Deposits Mobilise Rs 7 Trillion","summary":"Indian commercial banks recorded credit growth of 18.6% year-on-year by June 27, the fastest in two years. Deposits mobilised were nearly Rs 7 trillion, the third-highest fortnightly growth in 29 years.","why":"Bank credit growth is a key gauge of economic activity and lending demand, and it influences the outlook for India's banking sector.","category":"economy","event_type":"macro-data","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Mumbai","country":"India","lat":19.076,"lon":72.877,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"Rediff","url":"https://www.rediff.com/business/report/indian-banks-see-two-year-high-credit-growth-significant-deposit-mobilisation/20260711.htm"},"sources":[{"name":"Rediff","url":"https://www.rediff.com/business/report/indian-banks-see-two-year-high-credit-growth-significant-deposit-mobilisation/20260711.htm"}],"published_at":"2026-07-11T08:07:33Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-17T13:01:10Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"a00dcd4fa342a7a1","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-17T13:01:10Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-07-11T08:07:33Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-07-11T12:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"IN","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/bank-building-7133185.jpg","alt":"bank building (illustration)","credit":"dimitrisvetsikas1969","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/greece-volos-bank-of-greece-7133185/"}}